%N A399014 Triangle read by rows: T(n,k) is the number of quasi-(2k-1)-regular simple graphs on 2n+1 unlabeled nodes, 1 <= k <= n.
%C A399014 The graphs considered here have 2n nodes of degree 2k-1 and one node of degree 2k.
%C A399014 Equivalently, T(n,k) is the number of simple graphs on 2n nodes with 2k nodes having degree 2k-2 and the remainder having degree 2k-1.
